WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.381 --> 00:00:03.064
- I've never had any type
of vegetarian alternative

00:00:03.064 --> 00:00:04.781
to anything, so...

00:00:04.781 --> 00:00:06.673
- You've never had a veggie burger?

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:08.519
- What is that?

00:00:08.519 --> 00:00:11.102
(upbeat music)

00:00:12.991 --> 00:00:15.231
- I love everything about
like, not just the sushi,

00:00:15.231 --> 00:00:16.994
I love ginger, I love wasabi.

00:00:16.994 --> 00:00:18.096
- Yeah.

00:00:18.096 --> 00:00:19.922
- My sister gave me a spoon of wasabi

00:00:19.922 --> 00:00:21.635
when I was a little kid, and I
think I just became addicted.

00:00:21.635 --> 00:00:22.592
- That's kinda messed up.

00:00:22.592 --> 00:00:24.977
- I was a vegetarian for four years,

00:00:24.977 --> 00:00:29.234
and then I had to make
an exception for sushi,

00:00:29.234 --> 00:00:31.071
so I became pescatarian.

00:00:31.071 --> 00:00:33.617
- Now, since my girlfriend
is recently a vegetarian,

00:00:33.617 --> 00:00:35.984
now I've been looking all around the city

00:00:35.984 --> 00:00:38.677
for vegetarian restaurants
that both me and her

00:00:38.677 --> 00:00:40.177
can get food at.

00:00:40.177 --> 00:00:42.457
- I've had very sad vegetarian sushi,

00:00:42.457 --> 00:00:44.627
which is why I became pescatarian.

00:00:44.627 --> 00:00:46.154
- If it tasted just like sushi,

00:00:46.154 --> 00:00:48.038
I'd be happy with vegetarian sushi.

00:00:48.038 --> 00:00:50.001
- Maybe I can eat a little bit less fish

00:00:50.001 --> 00:00:53.524
and be kinder to the earth.

00:00:53.524 --> 00:00:55.022
- Hey guys, my name is Guy.

00:00:55.022 --> 00:00:58.754
I'm the chef and owner of Beyond Sushi.

00:00:58.754 --> 00:01:01.337
(upbeat music)

00:01:04.639 --> 00:01:06.996
I think of Beyond Sushi as something

00:01:06.996 --> 00:01:09.164
that no one is doing out there.

00:01:09.164 --> 00:01:11.814
It's first healthy and not just vegan,

00:01:11.814 --> 00:01:15.175
because not all vegan food
is healthy necessarily.

00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:17.836
We don't fry anything.

00:01:17.836 --> 00:01:19.711
And everything is balanced and unique,

00:01:19.711 --> 00:01:22.540
so you won't find these
combinations anywhere else.

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:24.636
For me, it's all about the package

00:01:24.636 --> 00:01:28.256
and the balance between
the flavors when you eat

00:01:28.256 --> 00:01:32.423
and colors and textures and
everything that comes with it.

00:01:35.047 --> 00:01:38.378
Spicy Mang has black rice,
English cucumber, avocado,

00:01:38.378 --> 00:01:40.633
mango on the inside, it's topped off

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:44.562
with semi-pickled cabbage,
carrots, and peppers.

00:01:44.562 --> 00:01:46.656
- (Max) So spicy mango is
one of my favorite flavors,

00:01:46.656 --> 00:01:48.342
so I'm excited about this one.

00:01:48.342 --> 00:01:50.889
- It looks very fancy.

00:01:50.889 --> 00:01:55.744
I love the little dollops of
sauce on top, that's so cute.

00:01:55.744 --> 00:01:58.060
- The plating is beautiful,
let's get that right.

00:01:58.060 --> 00:02:02.227
So already we're beyond sushi
in one sense of the word.

00:02:06.162 --> 00:02:07.975
I think it's delicious.

00:02:07.975 --> 00:02:10.731
I don't know if I would feel
like I was eating sushi.

00:02:10.731 --> 00:02:13.214
I feel like I'm in my own
kind of like food now.

00:02:13.214 --> 00:02:15.184
Although I guess like the
experience we're having

00:02:15.184 --> 00:02:18.058
of the way we just ate it
makes it really sushi-like.

00:02:18.058 --> 00:02:21.645
- I love the spice of it, it
has a really nice kick to it.

00:02:21.645 --> 00:02:25.909
- It also tastes really
healthy, vegetarianism aside.

00:02:25.909 --> 00:02:28.757
- The La Fiesta has sliced chayote,

00:02:28.757 --> 00:02:30.507
pickled jalapenos, avocado,

00:02:30.507 --> 00:02:33.207
and it's topped off
with a black bean puree,

00:02:33.207 --> 00:02:38.185
tomato guajillo sauce, and
a kefir leaf lime chips.

00:02:38.185 --> 00:02:40.684
- Beauty, man, beauty, okay?

00:02:40.684 --> 00:02:42.386
- This is very Instagrammable.

00:02:42.386 --> 00:02:45.136
- Yeah.

00:02:49.494 --> 00:02:53.661
- It has like the same consistency
as if it had fish in it.

00:02:54.533 --> 00:02:56.550
I literally cannot tell the difference.

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:58.392
- Yeah, I can't tell that
it doesn't have fish also.

00:02:58.392 --> 00:03:00.600
Because it has like some
kind of fish seasoning.

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:02.855
- I also feel like this could
be like a good breakfast,

00:03:02.855 --> 00:03:05.302
lunch, or dinner, like
any time of the day.

00:03:05.302 --> 00:03:07.345
- Even like midnight
snack when you have like

00:03:07.345 --> 00:03:08.950
that guilty conscience, and you're like,

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:10.879
oh I'm gonna get up right
now and grab something like,

00:03:10.879 --> 00:03:12.908
having two of these at like
3 o'clock in the morning,

00:03:12.908 --> 00:03:14.605
I feel like you'll be okay.

00:03:14.605 --> 00:03:16.375
I don't really eat that much vegetables,

00:03:16.375 --> 00:03:19.932
so the fact that I'm just
eating rolled up vegetables,

00:03:19.932 --> 00:03:24.412
it's like surprisingly so amazing.

00:03:24.412 --> 00:03:26.995
(upbeat music)

00:03:27.875 --> 00:03:30.765
- Pickle Me has six grain
rice on the outside,

00:03:30.765 --> 00:03:33.955
marinated carrots, pickled yamagobo,

00:03:33.955 --> 00:03:36.469
which is a burdock root pickled daikon,

00:03:36.469 --> 00:03:38.857
and it's topped off with an avocado layer

00:03:38.857 --> 00:03:41.204
and a carrot ginger sauce.

00:03:41.204 --> 00:03:44.388
- Did you say burdock root, Bodak Yellow?

00:03:44.388 --> 00:03:46.467
- I don't even know what
half of this stuff is.

00:03:46.467 --> 00:03:48.448
I've never even heard of these vegetables.

00:03:48.448 --> 00:03:50.782
- But I think that's the cool
thing about vegetarian options

00:03:50.782 --> 00:03:52.508
is because once you start to explore them,

00:03:52.508 --> 00:03:54.989
you start to explore all these
different types of vegetables

00:03:54.989 --> 00:03:56.655
that you never knew existed.

00:03:56.655 --> 00:03:58.418
- And so many different flavors.

00:03:58.418 --> 00:04:01.200
It actually looks like
there's raw fish in there,

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:02.750
do you see that?

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:05.640
I'm excited, it smells
like seafood though.

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:06.713
- No, it don't.

00:04:06.713 --> 00:04:08.120
- Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:11.370
I smell the seaweed, that's what it is.

00:04:12.233 --> 00:04:14.190
- That shit is bomb.

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:17.229
- It's like still coming in,
like flavors are still coming.

00:04:17.229 --> 00:04:19.077
- And the texture kind of reminds me

00:04:19.077 --> 00:04:20.976
of like yellowtail, so that's cool.

00:04:20.976 --> 00:04:24.381
- It's sweet.

00:04:24.381 --> 00:04:27.721
It's like ginger carrot.

00:04:27.721 --> 00:04:31.546
Mm, this is the D and Eric approved move.

00:04:31.546 --> 00:04:33.696
(laughs)

00:04:33.696 --> 00:04:34.936
(upbeat music)

00:04:34.936 --> 00:04:37.365
- I don't know any
vegetarians unfortunately,

00:04:37.365 --> 00:04:39.420
but I think anybody would love this place.

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:42.375
- My favorite part of sushi is
always like the mango on top

00:04:42.375 --> 00:04:45.043
or like the different
flavors that they add

00:04:45.043 --> 00:04:46.733
to the actual sushi.

00:04:46.733 --> 00:04:48.544
And this is just like a combination

00:04:48.544 --> 00:04:50.197
of all the good toppings.

00:04:50.197 --> 00:04:51.620
- Speaking as a not vegetarian,

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:53.273
I think this would be such
a great place to get dinner

00:04:53.273 --> 00:04:54.857
with a vegan or vegetarian friend.

00:04:54.857 --> 00:04:56.980
It kinda reminds you that
there's a lot about sushi

00:04:56.980 --> 00:05:00.468
that's not in the sushi, in
the fish itself ironically.

00:05:00.468 --> 00:05:02.749
- I really enjoyed this experience.

00:05:02.749 --> 00:05:06.126
As someone who is mostly vegetarian,

00:05:06.126 --> 00:05:08.494
someone who usually
eats plant-based things,

00:05:08.494 --> 00:05:09.500
I love all the flavors,

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:11.358
I love how beautiful the rolls looked,

00:05:11.358 --> 00:05:15.154
they are much better
than a sad cucumber roll.

00:05:15.154 --> 00:05:18.115
And I would come back, I
definitely would come back.

00:05:18.115 --> 00:05:21.610
- It's awesome, you can
have healthier sushi

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:24.322
and healthier pockets,
who wouldn't want that?

00:05:24.322 --> 00:05:26.905
(upbeat music)

